# Skyknight Squire: "Whenever another creature you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. As long as this creature has
# three or more +1/+1 counters on it, it has flying and is a Knight in addition to its other types." The Squire itself entering gives
# no counter. Bot1's Memnite and Ornithopter give counters one and two: it is a 3/3 with no flying and still a Cat Scout (the static
# needs three). Isamaru gives the third: flying and a Knight (CR 613.1d, 613.1f), still a Cat Scout. The ability grants flying to
# nothing else (Memnite has none), and Bot2's Memnite entering gives no counter (it is not Bot1's creature).

